# English Learning MVP Implementation Checklist

## Phase 1: Planning & Setup
- [x] Brainstorming Ideas
- [x] Determine Architecture and Tech Stack
- [x] Create Design Doc
- [x] Setup Frontend Project (React + Vite + Tailwind)
- [x] Setup Backend Monorepo or Multi-module layout (Spring Boot)
- [x] Setup Database (PostgreSQL)

## Phase 2: Core Platform (API Gateway & Identity)
- [x] Build API Gateway
- [x] Implement User Roles & Authentication (Identity)
- [x] Integrate Frontend Auth State
- [x] Refine Auth Validation & DB (firstName, lastName, ExceptionHandler)
- [x] Refine Auth UI (Confirm password, Eye icon toggle, inline errors)

## Phase 3: Vocabulary & Core Learning Features
- [/] Backend: Vocabulary Service (Topics, Words, Progress)
- [ ] Frontend: Vocabulary UI (Topic list, Vocabulary Viewer)
- [ ] Frontend & Backend: Fill blanks Quiz and Audio Playback

## Phase 4: Advanced AI Features (Writing/Speaking)
- [ ] Backend: AI Assessment Service
- [ ] Backend: External AI API integration (OpenAI/Gemini)
- [ ] Frontend: Audio Recording Component
- [ ] Frontend: Speaking & Writing interfaces

## Phase 5: Other Skills (Reading, Listening, Idioms)
- [ ] Backend: Reading & Listening Quiz module
- [ ] Frontend: Reading UI & pop-up dictionary
- [ ] Frontend: Listening Audio Player and fill-in-blanks

## Phase 6: Verification & Polish
- [ ] End-to-end testing
- [ ] Performance and Error handling Polish
